    "body": "## v2.0.0-beta.1 — Early Preview\r\n\r\nThis is a pre-release for early testing. Expect rough edges — not recommended for production use yet.\r\n\r\n### What's in this preview\r\n- PR-merged event handling, with composed prompts for both social and direct formats\r\n- Initial pass at branch-based eligibility for social briefs\r\n\r\n### Known issues\r\n- Duplicate briefs can occur when a PR merge also triggers a push to the default branch — not yet resolved\r\n- No numeric floor yet, so very small pushes still generate briefs in every configured format\r\n\r\n### Feedback\r\nTrying this out? Let me know what breaks. Planning to iterate before tagging a stable v2.0.0."
